      "content": "i mean i know i should probably see someone but im just so exhausted and honestly a little scared to go to the clinic if it's nothing serious. like, could it just be that my body is still fighting the virus? i've been drinking a ton of electrolytes and trying to sleep more but the chest heaviness is still there. do you think i can just wait it out for another week or so and see if it gets better on its own?",
